        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a health care provider and as a business associate to health care providers, we are subject to federal and state laws governing privacy and security, including the Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act of 1996 (“HIPAA”) and its implementing regulations, such as the Privacy Rule, the Security Rule and the Breach Notification Rule.",
        "start_character": 47590,
        "end_character": 47938
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-014379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-014379-41dbd2a188d7ee05",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-014379",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "During fiscal 2025, we began to enhance our product offering in areas where we are underdeveloped relative to the optical retail category.",
        "start_character": 16398,
        "end_character": 16536
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-014379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-014379-41dbd2a188d7ee05",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-014379",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also continue to invest in digital tools, using technology to complement the selling experience wherever possible, to personalize the customer experience and showcase products and features.",
        "start_character": 24121,
        "end_character": 24313
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-014379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-014379-41dbd2a188d7ee05",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-014379",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that we are well positioned to win with Outside Rx customers, including by tailoring marketing messaging to better reach these consumers and evolving adjusting selling techniques and product mix to better serve them in the store.",
        "start_character": 22970,
        "end_character": 23210
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-014379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-014379-41dbd2a188d7ee05",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-014379",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have developed a high-volume, low-cost lens processing model to provide approximately seven- to 10-day turnaround service through our domestic owned facilities and our international partner facility.",
        "start_character": 30222,
        "end_character": 30424
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-014379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-014379-41dbd2a188d7ee05",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-014379",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer a range of services to customers, including eyeglass purchasing, online scheduling and appointment reminders, contact lens purchasing, “buy-in-store and ship-to-home” capabilities and online frame browsing, among others.",
        "start_character": 9219,
        "end_character": 9448
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-014379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-014379-41dbd2a188d7ee05",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-014379",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We then develop and execute highly targeted local marketing campaigns within stores to create awareness of our service and product offerings.",
        "start_character": 26671,
        "end_character": 26812
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-014379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-014379-41dbd2a188d7ee05",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-014379",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While our managed care business has continued to grow, we are underpenetrated in the managed care market relative to the broader optical retail industry.",
        "start_character": 22097,
        "end_character": 22250
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-014379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-014379-41dbd2a188d7ee05",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-014379",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Within our store brands, we primarily offer two products and one service: eyeglasses, contact lenses and eye exams.",
        "start_character": 15710,
        "end_character": 15825
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-014379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-014379-41dbd2a188d7ee05",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-014379",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In fiscal 2024, we began implementing transformation initiatives designed to accelerate long-term growth and strengthen profitability, including new additions to our executive leadership team, continued expansion of exam capacity, and new traffic-driving initiatives.",
        "start_character": 2186,
        "end_character": 2453
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-014379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-014379-41dbd2a188d7ee05",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-014379",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In our America’s Best and Eyeglass World stores, we also offer contact lenses from all major contact lens manufacturers, including our own private label brands (Sofmed and Natural Eyes HydraWear, made by CooperVision), along with a variety of eyewear accessories.",
        "start_character": 17662,
        "end_character": 17925
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-014379",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-014379-41dbd2a188d7ee05",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-014379",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The processing system is designed such that the more eyeglasses we sell, the more efficient the laboratories become, creating significant cost savings over time.",
        "start_character": 30859,
        "end_character": 31020
      }
